[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10382.15, "timestamp": "02:53:02", "text": "让我们把它做成一张大地图。三次跌倒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10385.15, "timestamp": "02:53:05", "text": "我们走吧。三"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10388.71, "timestamp": "02:53:08", "text": "瀑布。那真是太有趣了。实际上，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10390.63, "timestamp": "02:53:10", "text": "太搞笑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10403.87, "timestamp": "02:53:23", "text": "想要。想要。优雅的女士。想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10406.79, "timestamp": "02:53:26", "text": "女士。不，不是游戏内货币。你得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10413.51, "timestamp": "02:53:33", "text": "我不知道。我觉得我喜欢你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10415.469, "timestamp": "02:53:35", "text": "我知道我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10420.309, "timestamp": "02:53:40", "text": "单单是恐同症就令人恐惧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10422.23, "timestamp": "02:53:42", "text": "但当你和朋友一起做这件事时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10424.389, "timestamp": "02:53:44", "text": "是的。我不知道。你可以像死一样 10"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10426.95, "timestamp": "02:53:46", "text": "一万亿次，你也不会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10429.67, "timestamp": "02:53:49", "text": "感到困扰。好的。我开始了。你得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10431.75, "timestamp": "02:53:51", "text": "所有你想要的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10434.95, "timestamp": "02:53:54", "text": "我不会等待。呃，我该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10437.67, "timestamp": "02:53:57", "text": "有？我们是进行自由发挥还是像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10439.67, "timestamp": "02:53:59", "text": "就像廉价跑一样，或者我们是不是要去"}]